# Records docs/demo/test.gif from a real run: `vhs docs/demo/test.tape` from the repo root.
Output docs/demo/test.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 360
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 22ms

Hide
Type `export PS1='$ '` Enter
Sleep 2s
Sleep 2s
Type `clear` Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Type `brew test adeoluo/tap/corpus-dedup` Enter
Sleep 8s
